# Testing Rules

## Framework Stack
- Use **Vitest** and **React Testing Library**.

## Code Coverage Requirements
- Automatically generate tests for:
  - New reusable components
  - Business logic
  - Utility functions
  - API service layers
- Testing may be skipped *only* when changes are purely cosmetic (styles only, no behavioral changes).

## Strategy
- Avoid testing implementation details unnecessarily; focus on user behavior and contract correctness.